      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is real, and it's completely understandable that you're tired of fighting this constant battle. When everything feels like it's just grinding on, the idea of quiet is incredibly appealing. A small, manageable break—even a very short one—could offer a moment of peace right now. Consider letting go of the pressure to \"fix\" everything and just focusing on making the next few minutes feel a little less heavy.",
